    "93188900-0367-44fd-ab51-f55c305ead6a": {
      "id": "93188900-0367-44fd-ab51-f55c305ead6a",
      "displayName": "scene",
      "description": "Here is [my futuristic car](http://wp.me/P3dmoi-1pt) design. \n\n![](https://3dartdh.files.wordpress.com/2013/02/speed_car_cycles_render_wip_by_dennish2010-d4w3po2.png)\n\nI modeled, textured and rigged this car in [Blender](https://www.blender.org/). \n\nThe concept was created by [Piotr Kupsc](https://goo.gl/GtVuRb).\n\n![Future Car](https://3dartdh.files.wordpress.com/2017/02/concept-car.jpg)\n\nHere are some cool projects where this car has found a use:\n\n* [Futuristic Car painting contest](https://goo",
      "assetType": "model_3d",
